  ],
  "notes": "Specs run against SAM-expanded types (state machine, alias, rules, scheduler, API Gateway REST API). API method/path are matched in the REST API Body or Method resources; the path name is not stated by the prompt so it is not checked. The ground truth's role ARN placeholder (doesNotExist) is not tested. A literal alias ARN (stateMachine:name:qualifier) is accepted wherever a reference to the alias is. A Result of {\"value\": 1} fails result_one because the prompt says a result of 1. api_role and scheduler_role require the API integration (Method credentials or REST API Body) and the schedule target to reference a role trusted by that service, not merely that such a role exists. Scored on 5 real candidates: GLM53F returns {\"value\": 1} (fails result_one) and Gemini38F shares one role across its three EventBridge rules (fails own_roles, events_roles, start_execution_permissions); both contradict the prompt, so the checks stay."
}
